# Standing .45 stream-only join: geth + beacon MUST reach both .82 and .98.
# Do not enable full TUN mesh (l0-dual-hub.env) — SI exclusive occupy cannot
# mesh three wallets on the same logical port. .82 uses the local L0d TCP
# listener; .98 uses the public wire.
# EXTRA_BEACON_PEERS must be comma-separated (start-geth-beacon-only.sh IFS=,).
# Do not put overlay VIPs 100.64.0.6 / 100.64.0.7 here (no TUN).
L0_STREAM_ONLY=1
L0_ONLY=0
L0_DHT=0
EXTRA_BEACON_PEERS=/ip4/127.0.0.1/tcp/14200/p2p/16Uiu2HAmDJCHuVkXtkPrrL8YykQ9gFZnQkR9Q6WjZZUrmueohPfd,/ip4/198.251.77.98/tcp/4200/p2p/16Uiu2HAmF1SXGHnne9DQTHGfgGQgje3cBV8pdSLJF25ajYKr2hvS
